app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on

help (types)
  up      ↑     scroll up          on
  down    ↓     scroll down        on
  pgup    pgup  page up            on
  pgdown  pgdn  page down          on
  home    home  top                on
  end     end   bottom             on
  tab     tab   find a key         on
  esc     esc   clear, then close  on
  ?       ?     close              on
